# JavaFX package -> its module, for Apache's RewriteMap "fxmodule": old flat
# links (/JavaFX11/javafx/scene/Node.html) gain the module dir that JavaFX 11+
# javadoc nests pages under. Packages have never moved between modules, so one
# map serves every version. It is the union of the element-lists of the
# JavaFX javadoc we serve; regenerate it when javafx.map gains a version:
#   awk '/^module:/ { m = substr($0, 8); next } { gsub("\\.", "/"); print $0, m }' \
#     org.openjfx/javafx-base/*/element-list | sort -u
